  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Đặt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Dựng hình chữ nhật <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Do vật ở trạng thái cân bằng nên\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⇔</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⇔</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\t\n\t\t\tTa có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></semantics></math>,